flowchart TD
  Step[原逐组件遍历] --> Target{当前是private终点?}
  Target -->|否| Ordinary[沿用/首次普通只读守卫]
  Target -->|是| Cached{存在缓存守卫?}
  Cached -->|否| First[首次开private=True<br/>入原cache]
